  "recordType": "rule-part",
  "ruleText": "PART Env-Wq 304 CERTIFICATION OF WASTEWATER TREATMENT PLANT OPERATORS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 485-A:5-a; RSA 485-A:6, XI and XI-b; RSA 485-A:7-a;\n\nRSA 485-A:7-b; RSA 485-A:7-c; RSA 485-A:7-d; RSA 486:9;\n\nRSA 486:10, III\n\nRevision Note #1:\n\nDocument #10392, effective 8-1-13, readopted with amendments and renumbered former Part Env-Ws 901 titled “Certification of Wastewater Treatment Plant Operators” under a new subtitle as Part Env-Wq 304. The redesignation from subtitle Env-Ws to subtitle Env-Wq was done pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05.\n\nDocument #10392 replaced all prior filings for rules formerly in Env-Ws 901. The prior filings for rules in the former Env-Ws 901 included the following documents:\n\n#1774, eff 7-15-81\n\n#2352, eff 4-26-83\n\n#2851, eff 9-21-84, EXPIRED: 9-21-90\n\n#6326, INTERIM, eff 9-3-96, EXPIRED: 1-1-97\n\n#6502, eff 4-25-97\n\n#8327, eff 4-23-05\n\nREVISION NOTE #2:\n\nDocument #13755, effective 9-27-23, readopted with amendment Part Env-Wq 304 titled “Certification of Wastewater Treatment Plant Operators.” Document #13755 was the first filing since Document #10392 that affected Part Env-Wq 304 and replaces all prior filings for rules in the former Part Env-Wq 304. The rules in Document #10392 did not expire on 8-1-23 but were extended pursuant to RSA 541-A:14-a until replaced by the rules in Document #13755, effective 9-27-23.\n\nThe amendments in Document #13755 made extensive changes to the former Part Env-Wq 304, including the readoption with amendment and renumbering of Env-Wq 304.06 titled “Operator in Responsible Charge - Multiple Plants” as Env-Wq 304.26 titled “Request for Multi-Plant Certified Operator Endorsement” Document #13755 also deleted Env-Wq 304.11 titled “Information Required for Application” and inserted a new rule Env-Wq 304.25 titled “Wastewater Treatment Plant Operator Code of Ethics. These changes necessitated the renumbering by Document #13755 of existing rules in Part Env-Wq 304 as indicated in the source notes.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq300.html"
